trikes flashy dance poses, its tail swishing in time with the music. Other cartoon animals join in, forming a lively dance crew around it. The scene is filled with shimmering effects, flashing strobes, and a fun, upbeat atmosphere that makes the dance come to life.","output":{"url":"https://huggingface.co/kandinskylab/Kandinsky-5.0-T2V-Lite-LoRa-Microwave-left/resolve/main/examples/12.mp4"}}]},"lastModified":"2025-11-26T11:09:43.000Z","likes":0,"downloads":0,"pipeline_tag":"text-to-video"},{"_id":"691d9eb732a0e7633b77bfce","id":"kandinskylab/Kandinsky-5.0-T2V-Lite-LoRa-Microwave-right","cardData":{"license":"mit","language":["en","ru"],"base_model":["kandinskylab/Kandinsky-5.0-T2V-Lite-sft-5s"],"pipeline_tag":"text-to-video","tags":["text-to-video","lora"],"widget":[{"text":"'M1CR0W4V3 r0t4tION, 360-degree rotation. Animated scene begins with a close-up of a short, fluffy monster kneeling beside a melting red candle. The monster, with wide eyes and an open mouth, stares in awe at the flickering flame, its soft fur catching the warm, golden glow. The 3D and realistic art style highlights intricate textures in the monster’s fur and the candle's glossy, melting wax. Dramatic lighting casts gentle shadows, creating a cozy and magical atmosphere filled with wonder and curiosity. As the candle continues to melt, the monster reaches out tentatively, its playful innocence and fascination with the flame becoming more evident with each passing moment.","output":{"url":"https://huggingface.co/kandinskylab/Kandinsky-5.0-T2V-Lite-LoRa-Microwave-right/resolve/main/examples/4.mp4"}},{"text":"'M1CR0W4V3 r0t4tION, 360-degree rotation. A close-up shot captures the elegant beauty of a Victoria crowned pigeon, its vibrant blue feathers glistening under soft lighting. The bird’s chest is adorned with a deep red hue that contrasts beautifully against its plumage. A graceful crest of lacy, white-tipped feathers crowns its head, framing its piercing red eyes that seem to gaze directly at t