ns bustle along the sidewalks, their silhouettes blending into the dynamic, cinematic atmosphere of the neon-lit metropolis.","output":{"url":"https://huggingface.co/kandinskylab/Kandinsky-5.0-T2V-Lite-LoRa-Arc-right/resolve/main/examples/0.mp4"}},{"text":"'r0t4tION orb1t, 360-degree camera orbit. Animated scene begins with a close-up of a short, fluffy monster kneeling beside a melting red candle. The monster, with wide eyes and an open mouth, stares in awe at the flickering flame, its soft fur catching the warm, golden glow. The 3D and realistic art style highlights intricate textures in the monster’s fur and the candle's glossy, melting wax. Dramatic lighting casts gentle shadows, creating a cozy and magical atmosphere filled with wonder and curiosity. As the candle continues to melt, the monster reaches out tentatively, its playful innocence and fascination with the flame becoming more evident with each passing moment.","output":{"url":"https://huggingface.co/kandinskylab/Kandinsky-5.0-T2V-Lite-LoRa-Arc-right/resolve/main/examples/4.mp4"}},{"text":"'r0t4tION orb1t, 360-degree camera orbit. A close-up shot captures the elegant beauty of a Victoria crowned pigeon, its vibrant blue feathers glistening under soft lighting. The bird’s chest is adorned with a deep red hue that contrasts beautifully against its plumage. A graceful crest of lacy, white-tipped feathers crowns its head, framing its piercing red eyes that seem to gaze directly at the viewer. The pigeon tilts its head slightly to the side, exuding a sense of regal curiosity and majesty. The background is softly blurred, enhancing the focus on the bird’s intricate details and noble presence.","output":{"url":"https://huggingface.co/kandinskylab/Kandinsky-5.0-T2V-Lite-LoRa-Arc-right/resolve/main/examples/6.mp4"}},{"text":"'r0t4tION orb1t, 360-degree camera orbit. A cartoon kangaroo bounces energetically into a vibrant disco club filled with colorful lights and pulsing music. It strikes a pose on the dance floor, then begins to disco dance with exaggerated, bouncy moves that match the rhythm of the beat. The kangaroo spins, twirls, and strikes flashy dance poses, its tail swishing in time with the music. Other cartoon animals join in, forming a lively dance crew around it. The scene is filled with shimmering effects, flashing strobes, and a fun, upbeat atmosphere that makes the dance come to life.","output":{"url":"https://huggingface.co/kandinskylab/Kandinsky-5.0-T2V-Lite-LoRa-Arc-right/resolve/main/examples/12.mp4"}}]},"lastModified":"2025-11-26T11:09:24.000Z","likes":0,"downloads":0,"pipeline_tag":"text-to-video"},{"_id":"691da00beea57197c0668d43","id":"kandinskylab/Kandinsky-5.0-T2V-Lite-LoRa-Truck-left","cardData":{"license":"mit","language":["en","ru"],"base_model":["kandinskylab/Kandinsky-5.0-T2V-Lite-sft-5s"],"pipeline_tag":"text-to-video","tags":["text-to-video","lora"],"widget":[{"text":"'TR4CK L3F7, TRUCK LEFT. A breathtaking scene unfolds as several massive wooly mammoths slowly traverse a serene, snowy meadow, their thick, shaggy fur gently swaying in the crisp winter breeze. Snow-laden trees line the landscape, standing tall against the backdrop of towering, snow-capped mountains in the distance. The mid-afternoon sun casts a warm golden light across the scene, illuminating wispy clouds that drift lazily across the sky. The camera is positioned low to the ground, capturing the grandeur of the mammoths up close, with a shallow depth of field that accentuates their massive forms. As they move forward, the mammoths occasionally stomp their feet, sending small puffs of snow into the air, adding a dynamic and lifelike energy to the scene.","output":{"url":"https://huggingface.co/kandinskylab/Kandinsky-5.0-T2V-Lite-LoRa-Truck-left/resolve/main/examples/1.mp4"}},{"text":"'TR4CK L3F7, TRUCK LEFT. A close-up view reveals a delicate glass sphere containing a miniature zen garden, complete with smooth stones and fine sand. Inside the sphere, a small dwarf carefully rakes the sand, forming intricate patterns with each deliberate motion. Sunlight filters through the glass, casting soft shadows that dance across the tiny landscape. As the dwarf moves, the patterns shift and evolve, creating a calming, meditative rhythm. Occasionally, a gentle breeze causes a few grains of sand to swirl briefly before settling again.","output":{"url":"https://huggingface.co/kandinskylab/Kandinsky-5.0-T2V-Lite-LoRa-Truck-left/resolve/main/examples/10.mp4"}}]},"lastModified":"2025-11-26T11:09:31.000Z","likes":0,"downloads":0,"pipeline_tag":"text-to-video"},{"_id":"691da0228de72e34f77cf4c3","id":"kandinskylab/Kandinsky-5.0-T2V-Lite-LoRa-Truck-right","cardData":{"license":"mit","language":["en","ru"],"base_model":["kandinskylab/Kandinsky-5.0-T2V-Lite-sft-5s"],"pipeline_tag":"text-to-video","tags":["text-to-video","lora"],"widget":[{"text":"'TR4CK R1GH7, TRUCK RIGHT. A breathtaking scene unfolds as several massive wooly mammoths slowly traverse a serene, snowy meadow, their thick, shaggy fur gently swaying in the crisp winter breeze. Snow-laden trees line the landscape, standing tall against the backdrop of towering, snow-capped mountains in the distance. The mid-afternoon sun casts a warm golden light across the scene, illuminating wispy clouds that drift lazily across the sky. The camera is positioned low to the ground, capturing the grandeur of the mammoths up close, with a shallow depth of field that accentuates their massive forms. As they move forward, the mammoths occasionally stomp their feet, sending small puffs of snow into the air, adding a dynamic and lifelike energy to the scene.","output":{"url":"https://huggingface.co/kandinskylab/Kandinsky-5.0-T2V-Lite-LoRa-Truck-right/resolve/main/examples/1.mp4"}},{"text":"'TR4CK R1GH7, TRUCK RIGHT. A close-up view reveals a delicate glass sphere containing a miniature zen garden, complete with smooth stones and fine sand. Inside the sphere, a small dwarf carefully rakes the sand, forming intricate patt